<view class="page"><view class="card head"><view class="title">番茄专注</view><view class="muted">{{label}} · 今日已专注 {{today}} 分钟</view></view><view class="timer"><view class="time">{{minutes < 10 ? '0' + minutes : minutes}}:{{seconds < 10 ? '0' + seconds : seconds}}</view><view class="muted white">专注时请将注意力留给一件事</view></view><view class="picker-card"><view class="picker-title">设定倒计时</view><view class="wheel-shell"><view class="wheel-pointer left-pointer"></view><picker-view class="wheel" value="{{pickerValue}}" indicator-style="height: 72rpx; background: transparent" bindchange="pickerChange"><picker-view-column><view wx:for="{{minuteOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="wheel-item">{{item}} 分</view></picker-view-column><picker-view-column><view wx:for="{{secondOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="wheel-item">{{item}} 秒</view></picker-view-column></picker-view><view class="wheel-pointer right-pointer"></view></view></view><view class="card strict"><view><view class="strict-title">严格专注</view><view class="muted">开始专注后，退出小程序将自动消耗 1 次离开机会；共 3 次，每次最多 5 分钟。</view></view><switch checked="{{strict}}" color="#1677ff" bindchange="toggleStrict"/></view><view wx:if="{{strict}}" class="card passes"><view>剩余离开机会：<text>{{breaksLeft}} / 3</text></view><view wx:if="{{onBreak}}" class="break-time">返回后可查看：临时离开剩余 {{breakSeconds}} 秒</view><view wx:else class="muted">不需要点击申请，离开小程序即自动开始计时。</view><view wx:if="{{lastBreakText}}" class="break-summary">本次临时离开：已用 {{lastBreakText}}</view></view><button class="primary main" bindtap="toggle">{{running?'暂停':'开始专注'}}</button><view class="card tip"><view class="tip-title">手机端使用建议</view><view class="muted">小程序无法把实时倒计时显示在手机顶部；要真正限制其他 App，请同时开启手机系统的专注模式。</view></view></view>
